{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":493797,"name":"Adam Purslow","username":"Adam_Purslow","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/a/e47774/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-17T10:33:07.191Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-493797-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-493797-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-493797-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-493797-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot: one bot (TLC Outbounds) Failed to send; others OK - please restart runner only. I have had this with 2 different bots today. One was new so I deleted but the other is old and  now won’t respond. Any help appreciated. I see there was an issue yesterday but it’s been closed. Of 5 bots, 3 are fine.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-493797-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-493797-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eJust send a message on the bot mentioned here.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-493797-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-493797-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI get a response, I currently get nothing. Then after a while I get a note saying it’s failed. The computer is attached and is on.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-493797-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-493797-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScreenshots / Screen Recordings\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbo